{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026tufRGBjafY1792716190.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國總統特朗普質疑伊朗有意在美國中期選舉前推高油價，他表明可能採取進一步行動，伊朗就稱做好應對準備。</p><p></p><p>特朗普周四表示，德黑蘭政府在霍爾木茲海峽製造虛假襲擊，目的是推高油價。他又宣稱美軍已痛擊伊朗，將來可能採取進一步行動，確保伊方無法擁有核武，但他沒有透露細節。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.US.IRAN-0800_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Ca6qGaSm4n1792716187.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>伊朗軍方就稱，在霍爾木茲海峽部署水雷，以及各種自動化控制系統，敵方船艦一旦進入海峽將成為伊朗打擊目標。軍方又指在生產無人機方面，無論是數量或質量都達成相對成熟水平。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.US.IRAN-0800_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ClEd3AKkFH1792716287.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T02:25:21.250876+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T00:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:18:10.025381+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T02:18:09.807114+00:00","content_hash":"6a676cf4bc6499a48bb86ae448477c6009e487ea66b7efbdeb3acb41b2927e7a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T02:25:21.250876+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}